{"id":"096b350f2180027d","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-normal-conditional-join-equivalence.md","title":"正规基项目标下两类条件语义一致","display":"thm-normal-conditional-join-equivalence — 正规基项目标下两类条件语义一致","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"theorem","label":"56-thm-normal-conditional-join-equivalence","aliases":["56-thm-normal-conditional-join-equivalence"],"display":"thm-normal-conditional-join-equivalence — 正规基项目标下两类条件语义一致","depends_on":["[[56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite]]","[[56-thm-conditional-semantics-fixed-points]]"],"source_section":"§3.5 paragraph following Definition 3.5.3","source_printed_pages":"82","source_statement_status":"source-claim-compared; local-layerwise-proof-supplied","source_proof_status":"local-proof-reviewed; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-normal-conditional-join-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-normal-conditional-join-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-normal-conditional-join-equivalence — 正规基项目标下两类条件语义一致"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b1c8fb0e112e49fa\" href=\"?note=b1c8fb0e112e49fa\" title=\"56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite\">56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0f6cdd1b3e994e97\" href=\"?note=0f6cdd1b3e994e97\" title=\"56-thm-conditional-semantics-fixed-points\">56-thm-conditional-semantics-fixed-points</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§3.5 paragraph following Definition 3.5.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"82"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"source-claim-compared; local-layerwise-proof-supplied"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"local-proof-reviewed; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b1c8fb0e112e49fa\" href=\"?note=b1c8fb0e112e49fa\" title=\"56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite\">56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite</a> 的全部结构，假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormalCTRS}(\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{NormalCTRS}(\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal C)\\)</span>。模式1为可汇合条件，模式2为定向有限归约条件；两类均从空关系构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CSat}_{T,m}(X,s,t)\">\\(\\mathrm{CSat}_{T,m}(X,s,t)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ground}_{\\Sigma,V}(t)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ground}_{\\Sigma,V}(t)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NF}(T,X,t)\">\\(\\mathrm{NF}(T,X,t)\\)</span> 沿用该定义中的条件、基项与正规形接口。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(U_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 为删去条件后的无条件关系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall X\\subseteq U_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\forall s,n\\in T\\;\\bigl(\n&amp;\\mathrm{Ground}_{\\Sigma,V}(n)\\land\\mathrm{NF}(T,U_{\\mathcal C},n)\\\\\n&amp;\\Rightarrow\n(\\mathrm{CSat}_{T,1}(X,s,n)\\iff\\mathrm{CSat}_{T,2}(X,s,n))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall X\\subseteq U_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\forall s,n\\in T\\;\\bigl(\n&amp;\\mathrm{Ground}_{\\Sigma,V}(n)\\land\\mathrm{NF}(T,U_{\\mathcal C},n)\\\\\n&amp;\\Rightarrow\n(\\mathrm{CSat}_{T,1}(X,s,n)\\iff\\mathrm{CSat}_{T,2}(X,s,n))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;Y_{\\mathcal C,k}^{1}=Y_{\\mathcal C,k}^{2},\n\\qquad J_{\\mathcal C}=N_{\\mathcal C}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;Y_{\\mathcal C,k}^{1}=Y_{\\mathcal C,k}^{2},\n\\qquad J_{\\mathcal C}=N_{\\mathcal C}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>已比对原书第82页Definition 3.5.3后的论断：normal系统是join系统的特例。若n在U下为正规形且X包含于U，则n在X下只能零步归约；所以s和n可汇合恰好等于s有限步归约到n。</p>\n<p>层等式对k归纳：零层均为空。由上游定理，各层包含于U；每个条件右侧d是基项，故任意替换均保持d不变，且它在U下为正规形。第一式于是逐条件保证两种算子对相同层给出相同下一层；取并得最后等式。这里比较同一语法系统的两种最小分层构造，而非仅在某个预先选定的合流关系内互换条件。未要求整个条件系统已经合流。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite","status":"resolved","id":"b1c8fb0e112e49fa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-conditional-semantics-fixed-points","status":"resolved","id":"0f6cdd1b3e994e97","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-conditional-semantics-fixed-points]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite","status":"resolved","id":"b1c8fb0e112e49fa","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-join-normal-conditional-rewrite]] 的全部结构，假设 $\\mathrm{NormalCTRS}(\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal C)$。模式1为可汇合条件，模式2为定向有限归约条件；两类均从空关系构造。$\\mathrm{CSat}_{T,m}(X,s,t)$、$\\mathrm{Ground}_{\\Sigma,V}(t)$ 和 $\\mathrm{NF}(T,X,t)$ 沿用该定义中的条件、基项与正规形接口。$U_{\\mathcal C}$ 为删去条件后的无条件关系。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{NormalCTRS}(\\Sigma,V,\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CSat}_{T,m}(X,s,t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ground}_{\\Sigma,V}(t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NF}(T,X,t)","display":false},{"tex":"U_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall X\\subseteq U_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\forall s,n\\in T\\;\\bigl(\n&\\mathrm{Ground}_{\\Sigma,V}(n)\\land\\mathrm{NF}(T,U_{\\mathcal C},n)\\\\\n&\\Rightarrow\n(\\mathrm{CSat}_{T,1}(X,s,n)\\iff\\mathrm{CSat}_{T,2}(X,s,n))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;Y_{\\mathcal C,k}^{1}=Y_{\\mathcal C,k}^{2},\n\\qquad J_{\\mathcal C}=N_{\\mathcal C}.","display":true}],"bytes":2217,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-286","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-normal-conditional-join-equivalence.md]]"}],"outgoing":["b1c8fb0e112e49fa","0f6cdd1b3e994e97"]}